{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Solar Symphony 是一款結合 NASA 真實影像、3D 動畫與超過 20 首樂曲的太陽系導覽應用程式，適合喜愛天文、宇宙與沉浸式音樂體驗的讀者。應用程式原價 US $0.99，目前於 App Store 限時免費提供下載。</p>\n\n<h2>互動 3D 太陽系與沉浸配樂</h2>\n<p>應用程式採用 NASA 官方影像製作行星與衛星，支援即時軌道運行、自轉與軸傾斜等動畫，並可自由調整觀賞角度與視角。每顆行星附有平均溫度等科普資料，配合管絃與人聲等多種風格的配樂，亦可啟用簡報模式自動帶領讀者遊覽整個太陽系，營造兼具教育性與娛樂性的觀賞體驗。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2688x1242bb-14-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2688x1242bb-15-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2688x1242bb-16-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2688x1242bb-17-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2688x1242bb-18-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2688x1242bb-19-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Solar Symphony</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T19:38:57.819536+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":311,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}